{
    "Description" : {
        "Id" : "event_mw_notAsItSeems",
        "Name" : "More Than Meets the Eye",
        "Details" : "You receive a summons from a Doctor in MedBay only to find to your surprise [[TGT_MW,{TGT_MW.Callsign}]] sitting down dejectedly before you all. {TGT_MW.Gender?NonBinary:They're|Male:He's|Female:She's} rocking back and forth in their chair, struggling to cope with the news.\r\n\r\nShooting the doctor a glare, \"OK, you have my attention. What is going on with {TGT_MW.Callsign}?\"\r\n\r\nDarius, who was already briefed of the situation speaks up, \"It appears that {TGT_MW.Det} clumsiness is due to a previously undiagnosed medical condition.\"\r\n\r\nPuzzled you reply, \"How did something like this get missed for so long?\"\r\n\r\nFinally drawing the courage to speak, the Doctor explains, \"You see, their condition was due to wear and tear. What made it so hard to diagnose was there were so few symptoms as {TGT_MW.Callsign} never complained about suffering from any form of pain in the past. Basically, they're struggling with spinal cord compression due to a narrowing canal in their neck.\"\r\n\r\n\"Alright, so what's our options then?\"",
