            "RequirementList" : [],
            "ResultSets" : [
                {
                    "Description" : {
                        "Id" : "outcome_0_0",
                        "Name" : "Continue",
                        "Details" : "After an awkward pause, [[TGT_MW,{TGT_MW.Callsign}]] opens up, \"I love piloting mechs. I honestly can't see myself doing anything else. If you will continue to put up with me, I will do my best to earn my keep here Commander.\"\r\n\r\nYou assure the pilot with a pat on the back, \"We've invested a lot of time and energy into you. The last thing we want is to give-up on you without a fight. If your condition gets any worse then we will cross that bridge together but for now, you take it easy as we need you on the field as soon as the Doctor clears you.\"\r\n\r\n\"You are clearing him, aren't you Doctor?\", Darius grins menacingly.\r\n\r\n\"Yes, {TGT_MW.Gender?NonBinary:they're|Male:he's|Female:she's} clear to go as their condition isn't currently life threatening nor causing any discomfort, but...\"\r\n\r\nYou raise your hand to prompt the MedTech to spill their disclaimer.\r\n\r\n\"As I was saying, with a fully upgraded Medbay at our disposal, we could easily perform the surgery and have them good as new in no time.\"\r\n\r\n{TGT_MW.Callsign} jumps out of {TGT_MW.Det} seat, \"Awesome! Thanks Doc and thank you Commander. You won't regret this!\"\r\n\r\nDarius turns to you, \"Seems like we some other options to look into Commander.\"\r\n\r\nYou wearily smile and nod as you make your way back to the bridge, now with another added expense to worry about. Deep down, you know it will eventually pay for itself so it's only a matter of time...",
